    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Condition · Balanitis xerotica obliterans\",\"title\":\"BXO / lichen sclerosus\",\"lede\":\"BXO, also known as male genital lichen sclerosus, can cause whitening, scarring and tightening of the foreskin. It may make retraction difficult and can cause discomfort or recurrent problems.\",\"reviewedBy\":\"u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/#haidaru0022u003eDr Haidar Al-Ali, BDS, MFDS RCPS (Glasg)u003c/au003e, September 2026\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Reasons\",\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/phimosis/\"},{\"label\":\"BXO\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap-narrow\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap-narrow\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>It can become a vicious cycle where a patient will try to retract the tight foreskin but cause micro tears in the skin. When it heals, this causes scarring which leads to more tightness and the condition worsens. Circumcision is a suitable long term option where the scar tissue and tight skin is removed which can relieve symptoms immediately.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>See also <a href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/phimosis/\">phimosis</a>, <a href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/adults/\">adult circumcision</a> and <a href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/aftercare/\">aftercare</a>.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:cil/callout {\"title\":\"Request a consultation\",\"body\":\"\\u003cdiv data-reveal\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003cspan class=\\u0022caps eyebrow\\u0022\\u003eBeing seen\\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n        \\r\\n        \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022body-text\\u0022 style=\\u0022margin-top:20px\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n          \\u003cp\\u003eYou can request a consultation or book by contacting the clinic. If you are booking for a child, please read the identification and consent requirements before attending. Tell us about any medical conditions, medication, allergies or bleeding problems when you book.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022btn-row\\u0022 style=\\u0022margin-top:26px\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n          \\u003ca class=\\u0022btn\\u0022 href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022book-condition\\u0022\\u003eBook a consultation\\u003c/a\\u003e\\r\\n          \\u003ca class=\\u0022btn btn-ghost\\u0022 href=\\u0022tel:+442089513794\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022call-condition\\u0022\\u003eCall 020 8951 3794\\u003c/a\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003cdiv style=\\u0022margin-top:26px\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022callout urgent\\u0022 data-reveal\\u003e\\n\\t\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022display d-3\\u0022\\u003eIf this is urgent, do not wait for an appointment\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\t\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:10px\\u0022\\u003eGo to A\\u0026amp;E today if a pulled-back foreskin is trapped behind the head of the penis and swelling, if you or your child cannot pass urine, or if there is spreading redness with a fever. Those need treating in hours. For anything else, call \\u003ca href=\\u0022tel:+442089513794\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022call-urgent\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue-deep);font-weight:600\\u0022\\u003e020 8951 3794\\u003c/a\\u003e and tell us what is happening, and we will bring you forward if you need it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"urgent\":true,\"level\":2} /--><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Describe it to us\",\"formId\":\"bxo\",\"subject\":\"bxo enquiry\",\"urgent\":false} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"title\":\"Book a consultation\",\"text\":\"You can request a consultation or book by contacting the clinic. Tell us about any medical conditions, medication, allergies or bleeding problems when you book.\"} /-->"
